# Colourings

Do not add a new colouring method in this repository. Add it in MetaMetro and open a pull request there.

Do not mock a colouring. Classifier colours come from Kraken2 or Kaiju through MetaMetro, or from a bench that already applied them.

Check that a selected colouring exists on the current ToCUMG. If the namespace is missing, stop.

Use MetaMetro colourings. `metamalevich --metametro-bench DIR --colouring kraken2 --colouring decaying` keeps those layers.
